  "disclosure": "SYNTHETIC, FOR EDUCATIONAL USE ONLY. There are no swaptions in the Treasury-only basis this pack ships on. This block is a synthetic at-the-money grid of normal (Bachelier) basis-point volatilities on longer-term Treasury yields, laid out on an expiry-by-tenor grid so it mimics the ATM swaption structure for teaching. Recipe: over a 5-year trailing window (2021-03-31 to 2026-03-31) the realized volatility of daily par-yield changes is annualized per tenor, then multiplied by a parameterized premium of x1.15 to stand in for the implied-over-realized wedge; the expiry decay is a parametric assumption. NOT MARKET QUOTES, not derived from any option price, and not usable for valuation. A user may substitute licensed market-implied quotes.",
